[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4983.03, "timestamp": "01:23:03", "text": "我覺得我死定了。我死了嗎？有人過世了嗎？我死了嗎？我的天哪，太可怕了。我的天哪，瘦長鬼影！修長的人。修長的人。  上帝。我的天啊"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4989.83, "timestamp": "01:23:09", "text": "。修長的人。  我的天，這小鬼來了。  哦，瞧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4993.51, "timestamp": "01:23:13", "text": "哦，"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 5001.043, "timestamp": "01:23:21", "author": "@Liuhanren", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/OLE5LPiBa-v1ogVYKu7h8YcPjvsCxlrbeKjfGGKC-jNV2c_i8v60sxtIJTiPHCb4gNrLz-yusQ=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "do you stream regularly?"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5010.87, "timestamp": "01:23:30", "text": "喬克。嘿。是的，喬。我想要的是頭部，但你知道，當有人說它在你身後時，你不知道該往哪裡跑，你就會想，我只能蹲在原地了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5017.75, "timestamp": "01:23:37", "text": "反而。糟糕。  看起來"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5022.709, "timestamp": "01:23:42", "text": "像“你好”"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 5026.417, "timestamp": "01:23:46", "author": "@Her_escapes", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/k5qSeiW9HuWS-yTlvFtkJFgjFQNzT4clVmOKs1PPP76ezfBidoUedboWgIi3wJy0ffSGpxX2Gy8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "not even regular.... he's like 24/7 on stream for now"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5036.229, "timestamp": "01:23:56", "text": "。  感覺就像你不知道該去哪裡一樣。"}]